SQLite — public domain
======================

This directory contains the unmodified SQLite amalgamation, version 3.53.4,
obtained from https://www.sqlite.org/2026/sqlite-amalgamation-3530400.zip.

SQLite is in the public domain. The upstream blessing, reproduced from the
source files themselves:

    The author disclaims copyright to this source code.  In place of
    a legal notice, here is a blessing:

        May you do good and not evil.
        May you find forgiveness for yourself and forgive others.
        May you share freely, never taking more than you give.

Public-domain material imposes no conditions and is compatible with this
project's Apache-2.0 license.

Only sqlite3.c and sqlite3.h are vendored. shell.c and sqlite3ext.h were
present in the upstream archive and are deliberately not included: the project
ships no SQLite shell and loads no extensions (the build defines
SQLITE_OMIT_LOAD_EXTENSION).

These files are third-party sources and are not modified. Build options are
applied from ../sqlite_cgo.go, never by editing the amalgamation. Verify the
tree against PROVENANCE.json with:

    python3 scripts/check_sqlite_provenance.py
